title: Land Reform Policy
choose-if: land_reform_policy_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: It is too early to change this policy again.
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_timer = 8

= Land Reform

The issue of land reform is a practically ancient issue in China, and one that Sun Yat-sen and other revolutionary leaders did not overlook. However, how exactly we should enact land reform, and to what extent, is still an open question.

Current land reform policy: 

- @radical_land_reform
- @moderate_land_reform
- @conservative_land_reform
- @stop: We shouldn't change our stance at the moment
- @back: Let us change a different stance

@radical_land_reform
title: A prosperous and equal China needs radical reform to break from the reactionary past
view-if: land_reform_policy_position != -1
choose-if: (ccp_dual_members_strength > (center_strength + right_strength)) and (left_strength > ( center_Strength + right_strength))
unavailable-subtitle: This proposal is far too radical for the party to tolerate
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_position = -1

In order to build an equal and modern China, the reactionary power base of the landlords and rural despots must be destroyed. A radical program of land equalization and uncompensated seizures should be enacted to return land to the peasants and build a strong and independent rural economy.

@moderate_land_reform
title: Land reform must be a peaceful and legal process, just as Sun Yat-sen devised
view-if: land_reform_policy_position != 0
choose-if: (center_strength > ccp_dual_members_strength) and (center_Strength > right_strength)
unavailable-subtitle: Radicalism has taken hold in the party to such an extent that even this propsal is deemed unrealistic
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_position = 0

Referred to by Dr. Sun as "Land to the Tiller," this program calls for land sales based on Georgist principles, as well as tax reductions, legal rights, credits, and agricultural modernization. It emphasizes peaceful and gradual reform so as to not stir up great societal unrest or mass violence.

@conservative_land_reform
title: A program of gradual reforms to reduce injustice will suffice
view-if: land_reform_policy_position != 1
choose-if: (right_strength > left_strength + ccp_dual_members_strength)
unavailable-subtitle: Such a tepid proposal is intolerable to the left-wing of the party
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_position = 1

The rural elite compromises the backbone of the agricultural, and thus Chinese, economy. Though injustice must be resolved, care must be taken to not alienate the landed classes. The government will incentivize land sales, but will primarily fall back on cheap credit for peasants and agricultural modernization.

@stop
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_timer = 4

@back
on-arrival: land_reform_policy_timer = 0
go-to: ideology

